s[1C**three[1Clines,[1Clike[1CMetro[1CMondego's[1Cnetwork[1Cdiagram**:[1CS1[1Cin[1Cblue[1C(Coimbra-B[1C→[38;2;80;200;80m[5;6H 248 +[38;2;248;248;242mSerpins), S2 in red (República → Serpins) and U3 in green (Coimbra-B ↔ República). U1 and U2 are[66X[38;2;80;200;80m[6;6H 249 +[38;2;248;248;242mnot drawn on their own. Lines are drawn **side by side** wherever they share a road, metro-map[68X[38;2;80;200;80m[7;6H 250 +[38;2;248;248;242mstyle, each in its own colour; a stretch used by one line is a single line centred on the road. The geometry is the[47X[m[2m[8;6H 251 [22m[1Cpure[1Cfunction[1C`bundleRoutes(shapes)`[1Cin[1C`src/domain/routeBundles.ts`;[1C`MapView`[1Conly[1Crenders[1Cit.[2m[9;7H252[22m[4C                                                                                                                                                                       [2m[10;7H253[22m[2C-[1C**Overlap means[1Cidentical[1Cvertices.**[1CThe[1Csource's[1Cshapes[1Cshare[1Cexactly[1Cidentical[1Cvertices[38;2;153;153;153m[11;6H...                                                                                                                                                                            [m[2m[12;6H 279 [22m     opposite-direction stops more than 75 m apart, would need this revisited.                                                                                            [2m[13;7H280[22m[4C-[1CMerging is drawing-only: `mergeDirections`[1Creturns[1Ccopies[1Cand[1Cnever[1Cmutates[2m[14;7H281[22m[6C`network.shapes`, and its[1Cresult[1Cdoes[1Cnot[1Cdepend[1Con[1Cinput[1Corder.[38;2;80;200;80m[48;2;2;40;0m[15;6H 282 +[38;2;248;248;242m- **Short-turn lines are drawn as their longer line.** After the directions are merged, a line[68X[38;2;80;200;80m[16;6H 283 +  [38;2;248;248;242mwhose edges are a strict subset of another line's edges is relabelled as that line, in its[70X[38;2;80;